# Plan decisions: a dependency cycle between static initializers is an error.
@known-failure Haxe 6 semantics (plan phase 8)
=== initial
@expect-error cycle
--- Main.hx
class Main {
	static function main() {
		trace(A.x);
	}
}
--- A.hx
class A {
	public static var x:Int = B.y + 1;
}
--- B.hx
class B {
	public static var y:Int = A.x + 1;
}
